"The chosen spatial discretisation method to use for each domain is passed "
"into the ```pybamm.Discretisation`` <https://docs.pybamm.org/en/latest/"
"source/api/spatial_methods/discretisation.html>`__ class as one of its "
"arguments. The default spatial methods for the SPM class are given as:"
